==Strategy==
This stage is balanced around having fully completed [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]]. If one doesn't have them, it is required to complete [[Cats of the Cosmos]] first, otherwise the Aliens will be too much for the player to handle.
With THREE Zyclones, a constant assault of UltraBaaBaas, Le'Solar nuking anything that comes within its range and Ribbo helping other enemies push, this stage is a force to be reckoned with. You should be prepared with certain Crowd-Controllers for the Zyclones and Barrier Breakers to be able to pierce through all the Starred Aliens' barriers; you also need Barrier Breakers that can hit the backline, as most conventional Barrier Breakers like The Kitty of Liberty and Space Marine Cat can't hit them behind the frontline. Units that can snipe Aliens and/or debuff the Zyclones are highly recommended.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: A staple in keeping the Zyclones in check. The Savage Blow talent is recommended for extra damage and to deal good damage to the Le'Solars while their barriers are down.
*[[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]]: A good midranger to kill the UltraBaaBaas, with its good range, guaranteed Barrier Break chance and decent attack rate and cooldown.
*[[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]]: Can completely freeze the Zyclones, albeit beware its low proc chance and Single Target.
*[[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]]: Able to snipe Le'Solar and especially Ribbo's barriers, this unit is crucial in killing the Ribbos quickly as their warp can cause you to lose too much ground.
*[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]: A meatshield that's Strong Against Aliens and Immune to Warp, it's great for stalling all the Aliens in this stage.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Bliza (Uber Rare Cat)|Blizarena]]: With Barrier Breaker, guaranteed Slow against both Aliens and Zombies and high bulk against both of them, she is a very potent Uber to bring to this stage thanks to these abilities.
*[[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravolodon]]: Powerful waver who can clear UltraBaaBaas, Ribbos and can deal hefty damage to Le'Solar. Just beware of his poor range.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: Targeting Red, Alien, Zombie and Relic enemies, she basically freezes every single enemy in this stage. Be aware of the barriers of the Starred Aliens in this stage; you have to destroy the barrier to freeze them. Still possible to freeze Znache and Zyclone with 400 range, with an [[Omni Strike]] between -100 and 450 range.

